{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-594980668933407420 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/bg1v1z-zg/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=594980668866298556&sectionId=594980668933407420)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_jnW8l5X5_text","label":"gg_jnW8l5X5_text","default":"<p><strong>I Saw Myself in My Friend's Photo From 2 Years Ago and Threw My Phone Across The Room – That's When I Finally Discovered Why I Gained 60 Pounds Eating 900 Calories</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPp4_CtBiX_text","label":"ggPp4_CtBiX_text","default":"By <strong>Marielle N.</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglr5gNNPty_text","label":"gglr5gNNPty_text","default":"<p>Last Updated Mar 3.2025</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggj2kmbnq_-_text","label":"ggj2kmbnq_-_text","default":"<p><strong>If you're reading this, you probably know the feeling</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That moment when you see an old photo and realize you've been lying to yourself about how much you've changed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For me, it happened on a Sunday afternoon. Fresh out of the shower. Sitting on the toilet seat because I was out of breath from standing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>My best friend posted a photo from 2 years ago. There I was. Size 8. Smiling. ALIVE.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I threw my phone on the counter. I couldn't look.</p><p>60 pounds gained. 900 calories a day. 9 doctors who said I was \"tracking wrong.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That night, crying naked in my bed, I found a YouTube video that changed everything.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Dr. Margaret explained what 9 doctors missed: Why my body was creating a hormone that jammed my metabolism every time I tried to diet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is how I lost 17.6 pounds in 12 weeks eating 1,900 calories. After 3 years of gaining weight while starving.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8Vj81XRvT_text","label":"gg8Vj81XRvT_text","default":"<strong>Rock Bottom: When Even Reddit Made Me Feel Hopeless</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRW_iN68BA_text","label":"ggRW_iN68BA_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;It'd honestly be so tempting to just starve myself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'd drop my calories to 900. And somehow I'd be up 10 pounds by the next month.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Like why couldn't I just be normal? Why did hypothyroidism have to turn my body into this?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I felt trapped in my own body. Whatever I did just added to the weight gain. I could see the puffy, swollen fatness building in my face daily.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>And the people in the Reddit groups? They just made me feel more hopeless. Saying the weight gain will never stop. Like an incoming train that just keeps going.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>My \"Perfect\" Routine That Made Everything Worse:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- Eating right (900 calories of lettuce and chicken)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;- Exercising (until I collapsed)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;-Taking meds on time (raising dose after dose)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;- Result: Feeling 1/10 to 2/10 AT BEST</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I tried everything Reddit suggested:</p><p>- Keto - gained faster</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- Carnivore&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- felt like death</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- Intermittent fasting - gained MORE</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- Switching to Armour - nothing</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-Synthroid - nothing</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- Cytomel - NOTHING</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The equation was simple: Do everything perfect = thyroid says \"haha, you gain more weight.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I was considering GLP-1 and surgery. Even though I knew those had to be dead last options. But I was already at the dead point.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwBnSIoNIg_text","label":"ggwBnSIoNIg_text","default":"<strong>The Sunday That Changed Everything</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXcjld3Nx__text","label":"ggXcjld3Nx__text","default":"<p>I remember coming out of the shower that Sunday afternoon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Looking at myself for a while. How much uglier my body had gotten. How much puffier my face had gotten.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then I saw my best friend's post. Me, 2 years ago.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I threw my phone on the counter. I was comfortable gaslighting myself into thinking I didn't look THAT much different. Even though I'd gained 60 pounds over 2 years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I wept and ran to my bed. Searching for solutions, I ended up sleeping in my puddle of tears. With nothing on.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Woke 5 hours later at 8 PM. Still tired. With the biggest headache and that coldness I constantly feel 24/7.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I opened my phone to text my mother that I give up. That I had to pull a loan and get the surgery.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But I was still on Reddit. And I saw people talking about this \"Dr. Margaret.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It was weird. I'd never seen so many people in a thread talk about 1 person.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqaZGTXA_2_text","label":"ggqaZGTXA_2_text","default":"<strong>The Discovery That Made Me Re-Watch The Same Video 7 Times</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5dSkQ3uSz_text","label":"gg5dSkQ3uSz_text","default":"<p>I clicked on her YouTube channel while still drowning in my own tears.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Her comment section was filled with girls with hypo just like me. Talking about how they finally lost weight after listening to her.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>After finishing that podcast? I finally had something to blame that was not me.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But a hormone my body was producing BECAUSE of how hard I was starving. BECAUSE of how hard I was trying.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>IT WASN'T ME ALL ALONG.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I re-watched this video like 7 times. Here's what finally clicked:</p><p><br><strong>I re-watched this video like 7 times. Here's what finally clicked:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The Lock and Key Disaster:</strong></p><ul><li>Your metabolism needs T3 (the key) to function</li><li>Your body makes T4, levothyroxine gives you MORE T4</li><li>Normal thyroids convert T4 → T3</li><li>Hypothyroid thyroids convert T4 → REVERSE T3</li><li>Reverse T3 = fake keys that JAM the locks</li><li>Real T3 can't get in = metabolism can't run</li></ul><p><strong>The Cruel Twist:</strong> Those extreme diets? They make it WORSE. The lower you drop calories, the more stress. More stress = MORE Reverse T3.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's why none of those medication swaps worked. Why raising levothyroxine didn't help. It just created more fake keys.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyAmcwjUKZ_text","label":"ggyAmcwjUKZ_text","default":"<strong>My 3 AM Research Rabbit Hole That Led to Hope</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtHf36GAlh_text","label":"ggtHf36GAlh_text","default":"<p>Dr. Margaret kept mentioning selenium, iodine, and zinc as crucial for thyroid conversion.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I researched like a mad scientist:</p><ul><li>1 billion people deficient in selenium (mostly Americans)</li><li>2 billion deficient in iodine</li><li>Without these minerals, your thyroid works AGAINST you</li></ul><p>At 3:06 AM (I had work in the morning), I found it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9kOq3vWn0_text","label":"gg9kOq3vWn0_text","default":"<p>It had EVERYTHING Dr. Margaret said:</p><p><strong>The Complete Protocol:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Selenium (200mcg)</strong> - Builds the enzyme that converts T4 to T3</li><li><strong>Ashwagandha (300mg)</strong> - Drops cortisol by 30% so stress stops creating RT3</li><li><strong>L-Tyrosine (500mg)</strong> - Raw material for thyroid hormones</li><li><strong>Zinc (15mg)</strong> - Lets T3 actually enter cells</li><li><strong>Iodine (100mcg)</strong> - EXACTLY 2:1 ratio with selenium</li><li><strong>Vitamin D3 (1000 IU)</strong> - Calms antibodies attacking thyroid</li></ul>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXk3JYZs3L_text","label":"ggXk3JYZs3L_text","default":"<p>SALE ENDS SOON</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_dayLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_dayLabel","default":"Days"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_hourLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_hourLabel","default":"hrs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_minuteLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_minuteLabel","default":"min"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_secondLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_secondLabel","default":"sec"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_weekLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_weekLabel","default":"Weeks"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFSc96f3xi_text","label":"ggFSc96f3xi_text","default":"<p>We only produce 5,000 bottles per month. With 4,726+ success stories spreading on social media, we sell out every 3 weeks. Next batch won't arrive for another 6-8 weeks.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2t5f4dfBF_label","label":"gg2t5f4dfBF_label","default":"<p>CHECK AVAILIBILITY NOW 👉</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVEAnsiX9o_text","label":"ggVEAnsiX9o_text","default":"<p>Sell-out Risk: <span style=\"color:#E30D0D;\"><strong>High</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggStiKq6yMT_text","label":"ggStiKq6yMT_text","default":"<p>|</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyzMTEHkRf_text","label":"ggyzMTEHkRf_text","default":"<p><strong>FREE Gifts</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIugrpED0F_text","label":"ggIugrpED0F_text","default":"<p>Try it today with a 30-Day Money Back Guarantee!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIgrMRAu_-_text","label":"ggIgrMRAu_-_text","default":"<strong>My 12-Week Diary: From Despair to Disbelief to Victory</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrROIC3n1g_text","label":"ggrROIC3n1g_text","default":"<p>I checked with my doctor. He said \"it's fine, just minerals.\" So I went right in.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Week 1:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Day 4: Scale moved down. First time since diagnosis.</p><p>Day 7: Down 1.2 lbs after 3 YEARS of nothing</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Week 2:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Day 10: Jeans don't cut into stomach when I sit</p><p>Day 14: Down 2.8 lbs. More than I lost in all of 2024</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Week 4:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Day 21: Belt moved in one notch. Actually needed it</p><p>Day 28: Down 4.3 lbs. Cried in bathroom. Happy tears.</p><p>Day 30: Posted: \"3 years post-diagnosis. FINALLY losing weight\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Week 6:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Down 7.2 lbs</p><p>Back in \"fat\" jeans from last year</p><p>Eating 1,700 calories (not starving)</p><p>Face isn't puffy anymore</p><p>Wedding ring fits again</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Week 8:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Down 11.4 lbs</p><p>Dropped full size (16 to 14)</p><p>Lost the \"thyroid tire\" around middle</p><p>Eating carbs again. Still losing.</p><p>Coworkers asking what I'm doing</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Week 12:</strong></p><p>Down 17.6 lbs total</p><p>Lost 1/4 of weight gained</p><p>Eating 1,900 calories daily</p><p>Can shop in regular sizes</p><p>Finally believe I'll get my body back</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxR467kh8y_label","label":"ggxR467kh8y_label","default":"<p>CHECK AVAILABILITY NOW</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoNtdcxfZZ_text","label":"ggoNtdcxfZZ_text","default":"<strong>The Birthday Party Where Everyone Thought I Got Surgery</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsYcSzFTjT_text","label":"ggsYcSzFTjT_text","default":"<p>I never thought I'd feel normal again.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Normal as in being comfortable in my body and able to talk confidently.</p><p><br>Normal as in walking without losing breath and not needing naps.</p><p><br>Normal as in having the will to live life again.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At my friend Melissa's birthday, 3 weeks after my 12-week mark, they flattered me. Touching my stomach, hips, everything. Asking if I'd gotten surgery or taken Ozempic.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No surgery. No Ozempic. Just fixing the mineral deficiencies that were causing my body to create Reverse T3 instead of real T3.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So girlies, if you're struggling with weight loss and hypothyroidism... If doctors keep dismissing you, telling you you're eating too much...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>IT'S NOT YOUR FAULT.</strong></p><p>You're not broken. You're not unfixable. We are ALL victims of our hormones and the betrayal of our doctors.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But you can fix this. Not in years. Not in months. LITERAL WEEKS.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Stop Letting Fake Keys Jam Your Metabolism</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Listen, I spent 3 years and thousands of dollars trying everything:</p><ul><li>9 different doctors</li><li>Every thyroid medication</li><li>Every diet that made things worse</li><li>Almost took out a loan for surgery</li></ul><p>All because no doctor would acknowledge that Reverse T3 was jamming my metabolism.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Peak Form gave me what my body was desperately missing:</p><ul><li>The exact minerals needed to convert T4 to T3 properly</li><li>The 2:1 selenium-to-iodine ratio that prevents flare-ups</li><li>Liquid form that actually absorbs (our guts are damaged from hypo)</li><li>Everything Dr. Margaret said was essential</li></ul><p><strong>147 days later:</strong></p><p>• Down 42 pounds</p><p>• Eating 1,900 calories</p><p>• Energy past 2 PM</p><p>• Reverse T3 cleared</p><p>• I'm ME again</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The woman who cried naked after seeing that photo? She got her life back.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXRGI6xMZ4_text","label":"ggXRGI6xMZ4_text","default":"<strong>Because unlike your doctors, they actually believe you'll lose weight.</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWs8EZzuGt_text","label":"ggWs8EZzuGt_text","default":"<p>SALE ENDS SOON</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggknY1rq8ZZ_dayLabel","label":"ggknY1rq8ZZ_dayLabel","default":"Days"},{"type":"html","id":"ggknY1rq8ZZ_hourLabel","label":"ggknY1rq8ZZ_hourLabel","default":"hrs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggknY1rq8ZZ_minuteLabel","label":"ggknY1rq8ZZ_minuteLabel","default":"min"},{"type":"html","id":"ggknY1rq8ZZ_secondLabel","label":"ggknY1rq8ZZ